    "A Year 8 topic enters the default pool only when status is enabled, enabled questions are at least 15, and formats contain an independent recall format.",
    "Opening the locked route loads the topic with core function TC, then filters with AC (exported as lt, imported as h) using includePreview true. AC removes status disabled. It does not remove preview when includePreview is true.",
