    "default-year8-enabled-candidate means the topic is in the default pool and the question status is enabled. It is not the set a single Daily session will serve: freshness, reservations and mode still apply.",
    "Year 9 curriculumTopics requires learning[topicId] === true. With an empty learning map, no Year 9 topic is in the default Daily pool."
  ],
